    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 20 Willow Wood, Faithlegg, Co. Waterford, X91 P2P6\n\nNo. 20 Willow Wood is a spacious and versatile four-bedroom detached dormer-style residence extending to c. 127 sq.m / c. 1,367 sq. ft. Occupying an attractive setting within the grounds of the renowned Faithlegg Hotel and Golf Club, the property combines generous family accommodation within the peaceful surroundings of one of County Waterford's most highly regarded country estates.\n\nThe accommodation is arranged over two floors and includes bright, well-proportioned living space suited to modern family life. A valuable feature of the ground-floor layout is a generously sized double bedroom with its own en-suite bathroom. This room would be ideal as a guest bedroom, an accessible principal bedroom or private accommodation for an older family member.\n\nAt first-floor level, there are three further bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with an en-suite shower room. A separate main family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms. The combination of a downstairs en-suite bedroom, an upstairs master suite and a family bathroom provides excellent flexibility for families, visiting guests or those planning for changing accommodation needs.\n\nOutside, the property enjoys an attractive residential setting within the established Willow Wood development. Its location offers the tranquillity and character of the Faithlegg estate while remaining within convenient driving distance of Waterford City, University Hospital Waterford and the extensive shopping, dining and leisure facilities available throughout the Dunmore Road area.\n\nFaithlegg Hotel is an elegant four-star country-house hotel centred around a restored 18th-century mansion and set within an approximately 200-acre estate. The resort offers a selection of restaurants and bars, spa and leisure facilities and an impressive championship golf course, with rolling fairways, mature woodland and views towards the River Suir. These exceptional surroundings help create a distinctive countryside lifestyle within easy reach of the city. \n\nWith its generous accommodation, flexible bedroom arrangement and exceptional setting, No. 20 Willow Wood represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial detached residence in one of Waterford's most appealing residential and leisure destinations.\n\nFeatures\n• Four-bedroom detached dormer-style residence \n• Approximately 127 sq. metres (1,367 sq. ft.) \n• Situated within the grounds of Faithlegg Hotel and Golf Club \n• Ground-floor double bedroom with en-suite \n• Three additional bedrooms at first-floor level \n• Master bedroom with en-suite shower room \n• Separate main family bathroom \n• Flexible accommodation suited to families and visiting guests \n• Peaceful setting within the established Willow Wood development \n• Four-star hotel, championship golf course and leisure facilities nearby \n• Convenient to Waterford City and the Dunmore Road \n• Attractive countryside location close to the River Suir and Waterford Estuary"
      },
